    """
    Merges two dictionaries into one. If there are overlapping keys, the values from dict2 will overwrite those from dict1.

    Parameters:
    - dict1 (dict): The first dictionary to merge.
    - dict2 (dict): The second dictionary to merge, whose values take precedence.

